  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-sourcepos=\"7:1-7:68\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Brand Introduction: Redefining Wellness Through Advanced Science</span></h3><p data-sourcepos=\"9:1-9:468\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">At Ascential, we believe in unlocking the full potential of nature's most powerful compounds. We are not just another supplement company; we are innovators dedicated to overcoming the limitations of traditional wellness products. Our mission is to deliver truly effective solutions by leveraging our proprietary delivery mechanism. We're passionate about empowering you to experience profound, lasting well-being through products that truly work.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><h3 data-sourcepos=\"11:1-11:89\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Product Description: Truemeric – Unlocking Curcumin's Full Power for Lasting Wellness</span></h3><p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:336\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Truemeric</strong> is a revolutionary wellness supplement designed to transform how your body absorbs and utilizes curcumin, the powerhouse compound found in turmeric. Unlike conventional turmeric products, Truemeric doesn't rely solely on ingredient potency; its unparalleled effectiveness comes from our <strong>proprietary delivery mechanism</strong>.</span></p><p data-sourcepos=\"15:1-15:491\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This breakthrough technology allows for an <strong>astonishing 150-fold increase in curcumin absorption</strong> into your bloodstream, ensuring that significantly more of this beneficial compound reaches where it's needed most. Even more remarkably, our advanced system keeps curcumin <strong>active in your bloodstream for 8-10 hours</strong>, providing sustained support throughout your day or night. This means consistent, long-lasting benefits that far surpass the fleeting effects of other turmeric supplements.</span></p><p data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:286\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">While Truemeric does include a carefully selected hemp extract, it is the advanced delivery of curcumin that performs the \"heavy lifting.\" The hemp is a complementary anti-inflammatory compound, working synergistically to enhance curcumin's profound effects and support overall balance.</span></p><p data-sourcepos=\"19:1-19:157\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Experience the Truemeric difference – where breakthrough science meets natural wellness to deliver consistent, superior results for your health and vitality.<br><br>• Payment terms: Monthly; PayPal&nbsp;</span></p></div></div>",
